# Input
```astro
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->

<div
    set:html={html}
    set:text={text}
></div>

<Component
    set:html={html}
    set:text={text}
/>

<div
    set:html={html}
>child content</div>

<div
    set:text={text}
><span>child content</span></div>

<div set:html={html} set:text={text}></div>

<Component set:html={html} set:text={text} />

<div set:html={html}>child content</div>

<div set:text={text}><span>child content</span></div>

```

